<title>UK: SmithKline shares off ahead of results.</title>
<headline>SmithKline shares off ahead of results.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in SmithKline Beecham Plc led other major UK pharmaceutical shares lower on Monday as investors took profits ahead of the release of SmithKline's results, dealers said.</p>
<p>By 1103 GMT, SmithKline shares were off 12p at 882. Shares in Zeneca Group Plc eased 23p to 1773-1/2, while shares in Glaxo Welcome Plc fell 12p to 1038.</p>
<p>-- Debra Sherman +44 171 542 4026</p>
</text>
